	<ThingDef ParentName="ArmorHelmetMakeableBase">
		<defName>KP_Armored_Gloves</defName>
		<label>Carapace Gauntlets</label>
		<description>Originally the Carapace Armor system did not include armor for hands. Many soldiers often complained about the lack of dexterity when handling their equipment, which left many of these gauntlets abandoned on the battlefields. Though when armies found themselves fighting the Insectoids during the War for Ramaal, many soldiers found the additional armor beneficial after seeing many of their allies dismembered. Bulky, cumbersome, and heavy, these gauntlets provide a level of protection that has kept many soldiers safe.</description>
		<techLevel>Industrial</techLevel>
		<recipeMaker>
			<researchPrerequisite>LateIndustrialFlakArmor</researchPrerequisite>
			<unfinishedThingDef>UnfinishedTechArmor</unfinishedThingDef>
