	<ThingDef ParentName="ArmorHelmetMakeableBase">
		<defName>KP_Talon_Gauntlets</defName>
		<label>Bladed Carapace Gauntlets</label>
		<description>After decades of fighting in the Trench-Cities of Meridia, the Trenchdogs eventualy found a compromise from ancient Earth. With a torch and a few pieces of plasteel, they added blades to their gauntlets which provided not only protection but an offensive form of fighting. The Trench Dance as the Trenchdogs call it was a form of combat which focus on the usage of these gauntlets to not only kill but kill quietly to avoid detection.</description>
		<techLevel>Industrial</techLevel>
		<recipeMaker>
			<researchPrerequisite>ModifiedGauntlets</researchPrerequisite>
		</recipeMaker>
		<graphicData>
			<texPath>Things/Pawn/Humanlike/Armor/ArmoredGloves/ArmoredGloves</texPath>
