	<ThingDef ParentName="ArmorHelmetMakeableBase">
		<defName>KP_Tauran_Gauntlets</defName>
		<label>Reinforced Carapace Gauntlets</label>
		<description>On the hiveworld of Malachos, the Last Battalion have fought for centuries agains the Sorne Strain. In the last remaining city of Kharos which has been besieged for hundreds of years, during the Hard Years many were forced into melee with the Insectoids. Their gauntlets have been modified to pierce the chitin of the insectoids with relative ease. Though they have to use combat drug to enhance their strength, these gauntlets were powerful enough to break chitin. The loving name of this for centuries have been called "Shellcrackers."</description>
		<techLevel>Industrial</techLevel>
		<recipeMaker>
			<researchPrerequisite>ModifiedGauntlets</researchPrerequisite>
