	<ThingDef ParentName="ArmorMachineableBase">
		<defName>BNF_Armor_Gorget</defName>
		<label>Gorget</label>
		<description>Designed to fix the strange issue with the armor which is a shallow protection for the neck which is a strange feature but does not seem to be ineffective armor. Unlike other forms of armor, the gorget serves a role more in line with the neck stocks of the ancient armies of Earth. Lacking, the design is not solely owned by a single world but is more often seen on worlds with aristocracies which see their nobles in the field. Despite this, it does come with a massive drawback which adds additional weight to the front of a soldier which leads to events know as turtling. As is written on the inside, try to keep good balance.</description>
		<techLevel>Industrial</techLevel>
		<recipeMaker>
			<researchPrerequisite>HeavyFlakArmor</researchPrerequisite>
			<unfinishedThingDef>UnfinishedTechArmor</unfinishedThingDef>
			<skillRequirements>
